          "depth": 2,
          "name": "How much per kilo?"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vendor:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Vendor:"
        },
        {
          "text": "One pound twenty. They're really sweet this week.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "One pound twenty. They're really sweet this week."
        },
        {
          "text": "Customer:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Customer:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Okay, I'll take half a kilo. Do you have any lemons?",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Okay, I'll take half a kilo. Do you have any lemons?"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vendor:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Vendor:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, right here. Thirty pence each or five for a pound.",
